Evidence for ToyOSOrg/ToyOS#976 (scheduler stage 2: topology and roster).

Home and source paths are written <src>, <dev>, <scratch>, <session> and
$TMPDIR; nothing else is changed or dropped. Revisions are ToyOS commits on
branch wt/toyos-topology-2, base d5713917d (#974).

