  ci-host.log                `cargo run -- --ci host` at dce097b4b: EXIT=0, 88 of 88 green.
  ci-host-cap-lift-red.log   the same at b34e6fb63: EXIT=1, clippy red (len_without_is_empty,
                             chunks_exact_to_as_chunks); fixed in dce097b4b.
  ci-host-part1-red.log      the same at f51c3b45e (part 1 before amend): EXIT=1, the new PPTT
                             fixture undeclared in build/licence.rs; fixed in 4ee067034.
  build-lib-part1.log        `cargo test --lib` (the build system's step) at 4ee067034: EXIT=0.

