  guest.log                  `cargo test --test toyos-build -- desktop_without_x2apic virt_smp
                             virt_failed_ap_leaves_no_hole` at dce097b4b: EXIT=0, 3 of 3.
  guest-virt-part1.log       `... -- virt_failed_ap_leaves_no_hole virt_smp` at 4ee067034: EXIT=0.
  guest-x86-part1.log        `... -- desktop_without_x2apic` at 4ee067034: EXIT=0.

