  x86-tcg-16.log             the tree committed as b34e6fb63: SMP 16 of 16, 15 APs join.
  aarch64-hvf-12.log         the same tree: SMP 12 of 12 through the PPTT.
  x86-tcg-4-part1.log, aarch64-hvf-4-part1.log
                             part 1 before commit: the first `topo:` lines on each architecture.

